entries[307065] = { ["name"] = "Purity's Vale", ["text"] = "Covenant Ability\n40 yd range\nInstant\nFeral\nFill the target area with anima for 16 sec. Within the vale your Primary Stat and Stamina are increased by 20%, and you gain Clearcasting every 4 sec.\n\nClearcasting\nYour next Shred, Thrash, or [ Brutal Slash / Swipe] costs no Energy [ Moment of Clarity : and deals 0% increased damage ].\n\nRestoration\nFill the target area with anima for 16 sec. Within the vale your Primary Stat and Stamina are increased by 20%, and you gain Clearcasting every 4 sec.\n\nClearcasting\nYour next Regrowth is free.\n\nGuardian\nFill the target area with anima for 16 sec. Within the vale your Primary Stat and Stamina are increased by 20%, and you gain Gore every 4 sec.\n\nGore\nResets the cooldown on Mangle, and causes it to generate an additional 4 Rage.\n\nBalance\nFill the target area with anima for 16 sec. Within the vale your Primary Stat and Stamina are increased by 20%, and you gain Solar Empowerment every 4 sec.\n\nSolar Empowerment\nCauses your next Solar Wrath to explode for an additional 4% of its damage to all nearby enemies and reduces its cast time by 4%." }
